<h2>What You Can Expect From Us</h2>
<p>Inspections are free and carry no obligation. We look at the full roof system, including shingles, flashing, vents, valleys and gutters, plus the attic when it is safely accessible. Then we walk you through photos of what we found. When work is needed, we provide a written estimate, and when a repair will do the job, we say so.</p>
